{"id":"steam-708660","steam":708660,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Anuran Evolution: Frog of War","summary":"Anuran Evolution: Frog of War is fast-paced multiplayer shooter starring battle-hardened frogs. \r\nGear up and outplay your friends with a wild arsenal of unique weapons in frantic, fun multiplayer matches to become the last amphibian standing.\r\n","about":"Anuran Evolution: Frog of War is a fast-paced third person shooter where you have a chaotic even with friends playing as battle hardened frogs fight. \n\n \n\nJump into compact battlefields with your friends, scramble for weapons and gear, and outplay rival frogs through smart positioning, fast looting, and chaotic combat. Every match is designed to create tense standoffs, sudden reversals, and ridiculous frog-fueled action.\n\n \n\nWhether you're ambushing from cover, rushing for better loot, or desperately trying to outlast your friends in the final showdown, Frog of War delivers the thrill of a battle royale in a smaller, faster, and more chaotic format, without the downtime of a full-scale match.\n\nFeatures:\n\n• \nFast, compact battle royale matches built for quick sessions\n• \nMultiplayer frog combat with firearms, gear, and chaotic amphibious action\n• \nCustomize and out fit your frog in a variety of outfits and cosmetics\n• \nLoot, reposition, and survive escalating chaos to become the last frog standing\n• \nBattle across atmospheric, stylized locations ranging from forests and farmlands to quiet small towns.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/708660/69051b955a2d90a77d772c9fea417f3e04d41e50/library_capsule.jpg?t=1777071954","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/708660/fef0a7549d84b376168d1a47e48abd6cd3920162/header.jpg?t=1777071954","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/708660/51a3324408b6f20b2b702b6bb6d9daf9acc5bb40/library_hero.jpg?t=1777071954","header":"https: